# PHPStan baseline — MoodleManagement v2.0
#
# @since 2.0 — V2.0-ACTION-PLAN F12.5 · §F12.5
#
# Snapshot of accepted errors at the time of v2.0 release. Adding a
# new error to this baseline requires:
#   1. A matching TODO in docs/V2.0-TASK-CHECKLIST.md or a follow-up
#      issue.
#   2. Reviewer approval on the release PR.
#
# The baseline starts EMPTY for v2.0 — every phpstan level 5 error
# has been fixed at commit time. This file exists so CI
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml, F9.9) can include it when future
# strictness bumps surface legacy findings; the intent is that each
# release leaves the baseline shorter than it found it.

parameters:
    ignoreErrors: []
